  "description": "A northern night: curtains of aurora with running rays, green at their feet and crimson at their crowns, cycle from quiet arcs through a substorm \u2014 flaring, racing, a corona overhead \u2014 to slow pulsing, over snowy peaks and a frozen lake that mirrors them. A cabin glows and smokes; a lone watcher stands on the shore.",
